<details class="plan-chapter" id="project-detail-2"><summary><span class="chapter-count">02</span><h3>Outdoor Kitchen Solutions Built for Lakewood, Colorado Backyards</h3>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="chapter-toggle">+</span></summary><div class="chapter-body prose"><p>Lakewood sits at the edge of the foothills with some of the best outdoor living conditions in the Denver metro mild summers, mountain views, and a community that genuinely uses its backyards. For homeowners here, an outdoor kitchen isn’t an indulgence. It’s a logical next step for a yard that’s already working hard.</p>
<p>Finding the right outdoor kitchen contractor in Colorado, though, takes some digging. A lot of companies offer outdoor kitchens as an add-on to other services. Very few have the in-house design and build capability to take a project from concept to completion without handing it off mid-stream.</p>
<p>Ridgewell Landscape and Design is one of those few. We’ve been designing and installing custom outdoor kitchens across Colorado since 2011; with design and installation planned together. One team, one process, one finished product that matches what you envisioned when the conversation started.</p>

