<details class="plan-chapter" id="project-detail-7"><summary><span class="chapter-count">07</span><h3>Why Lakewood Homeowners Choose Ridgewell for Outdoor Kitchen Design in Colorado</h3>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="chapter-toggle">+</span></summary><div class="chapter-body prose"><p>Colorado has no shortage of contractors willing to quote an outdoor kitchen. What’s genuinely harder to find is a company that manages the full scope well — design, materials, installation quality, and the day-to-day experience of working with them — from first conversation to finished project.</p>
<p><strong>Here’s what distinguishes Ridgewell:</strong></p>
