<p><b>Custom design that’s actually custom.</b> We don’t sell packages. Every outdoor kitchen we design starts with your yard, your lifestyle, and your goals — and produces a layout and specification that’s unique to your home. You’ll see and approve the design before any work begins.</p>
<p><b>Experience since 2011 building outdoor kitchens in Colorado.</b> We know what materials perform in Lakewood’s climate. We know the local permit requirements. We know what problems show up in Colorado outdoor kitchens five years after installation — and how to prevent them. That knowledge only comes from doing this work here, over time.</p>
